<title>FINLAND: AMER JAN-AUG SALES BY DIVISION.</title>
<headline>AMER JAN-AUG SALES BY DIVISION.</headline>
<dateline>HELSINKI 1996-10-10</dateline>
<text>
<p>Finnish sporting goods group</p>
<p>Amer-yhtyma Oy gave the following breakdown by division of its</p>
<p>January-August net sales (million markka):</p>
<p>				  Jan-Aug 96   Jan-Aug 95   Jan-Dec 95</p>
<p> Sports Division		 2,462	  2,476	  3,597</p>
<p>    Wilson			 1,954	  1,908	  2,714</p>
<p>    Atomic			   374	    417	    674</p>
<p>    MacGregor			151	    161	    221</p>
<p>    Less intercompany sales    -17	    -10	    -12</p>
<p> Automotive Division	     386	    359	    555</p>
<p> Tobacco Division		  256	    284	    472</p>
<p> Time/system Companies	   119	     88	    218</p>
<p> Less intercompany sales	  -1	     -3	     -4</p>
<p> Sold operations		   nil	  1,025	  1,328</p>
<p> Net sales, total		3,222	  4,229	  6,166</p>
<p>--Helsinki Newsroom  +358 - 0 - 680 50 245</p>
</text>
